        <p class=3D"section-body">
          Ridgeback Orchestrator is a simulation-capable, self-healing agen=
tic OS =E2=80=94 built from the ground up to coordinate autonomous field op=
erations across regulated industries.
        </p>
        <p class=3D"section-body">
          From landfill environmental monitoring to bridge and dam inspecti=
on, wildfire detection to utility corridor surveys =E2=80=94 Ridgeback tran=
slates commander intent into validated, auditable, multi-domain machine exe=
cution.
        </p>
        <p class=3D"section-body">
          Built in East Norriton, PA. Designed for the world.
        </p>
